<title>JAPAN: CTI Engineering plans share split.</title>
<headline>CTI Engineering plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>CTI Engineering Co Ltd said on Thursday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on February 20, for shareholders as of December 31.</p>
